name: sim.getDialogResult
description: msgBox or simUI.inputDialog instead.
luaSynopsis: int result=sim.getDialogResult(int genericDialogHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. genericDialogHandle: handle of the generic dialog
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. result of the dialog or -1 in case of an error.
2. Note. If the return value is sim.dlgret_still_open, the dialog was not closed and no button was pressed. Otherwise, you should free resources with simEndDialog (the dialog might not be visible anymore, but is still present)
replacedBy:
- use simUI functions
